      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better structure, removed unused imports, and grouped assertions with explanatory comments.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored `CharRangeTest_testHashCode.java` removes the seven unused imports, renames variables to be more descriptive (`singleChar`, `rangeAtoE`, `rangeBtoF`), and groups the assertions into three clearly commented sections — self-consistency, determinism, and distinctness — making the intent of each assertion group immediately clear to a reader."
    }
